<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Sakura, arranged by the Ongaku Torishirabe-gakari, in Collection of Japanese Koto Music (Tokyo Academy of Music)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1888</span><span class="sg-chain-h">arranged for koto</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Uta no hon (Ministry of Education school songbook)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1941</span><span class="sg-chain-h">a new verse added</span></li></ul></section>
